  "title": "Blueberry Oatmeal Chia Seed Muffins",
  "description": "These blueberry and chia seed muffins are super moist thanks to the addition of applesauce and orange juice. Great for an on-the-go breakfast!",
  "authors": [
    "Ruth Cresswell Howes"
  ],
